shunt (fork)

This plugin is a fork of "shunt" from spotify/portal-ai-plugins,
Copyright Spotify AB, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Upstream: https://github.com/spotify/portal-ai-plugins
Forked at commit: 3c24ca30ff63e1f5bbad1c43fe5324daff579123 (2026-09-18)

Modifications in this fork:
- scripts/lib/aika.sh (Portal CLI / AiKA transport) removed and replaced by
  scripts/lib/gemini.sh (AI Studio generativelanguage API, key via
  CLAUDE_PLUGINS_GEMINI_API_KEY header auth, payload via request body).
- hooks/bash-read-gate, hooks/read-gate: the final line-count judgment
  is replaced by a typed model decision (scripts/lib/gemini.sh shunt_decide,
  prompt frozen in scripts/lib/decide-prompt.txt), with the upstream line rule
  as the declared fallback when the model cannot be consulted. The decision
  also receives the file's first 40 lines (each cut to 200 characters) as a
  sample for judging content complexity. The Bash hook also passes the tool
  call's description (cut to 300 characters) as the read's stated purpose.
- hooks/bash-read-gate: only a redirect of stdout to a file skips the read
  check; upstream skipped any command containing `>`, including stderr-only
  redirects.
- hooks/bash-read-gate: shell -c wrappers (sh/bash/zsh/dash/ksh) are
  unwrapped and an absolute command path is reduced to its name before the
  read check.
- hooks/bash-read-gate, hooks/read-gate: allow is signalled by empty
  output instead of a JSON allow decision.
- scripts/bulk-read: worker output contract added (ANSWER / EVIDENCE /
  UNVERIFIED sections).
- evals/run_regression.py: regression harness comparing upstream and fork
  decisions over both hook eval corpora (evals/bash-hook-evals.json,
  evals/hook-evals.json), with added real-fixture cases under evals/fixtures/.
